{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>9to5Mac 由 MacPaw 旗下嘅 CleanMyMac 贊助呈獻。隨住 macOS 27 Golden Gate 推出，先用 CleanMyMac 釋放空間、優化系統，確保你部新 Mac 第一日就能以 100% 效能運行。了解更多。</p>\n<p>macOS 27 Golden Gate 係對 macOS 26 Tahoe 嘅一次重大升級，唔單止係設計決策更加明智咁簡單。就好似 iPhone 嘅 iOS 27 一樣，Mac 今次加入咗 Liquid Glass 透明度滑桿。用戶可以藉此大幅改變 Mac 整個系統嘅外觀。</p>\n<h2>滑桿</h2>\n<p>Liquid Glass 係 Apple 嘅設計語言，喺 iOS 26 同 macOS 26 Tahoe 開始採用。最初 Liquid Glass 只有單一外觀，Apple 後來新增咗一個設定，可以令 Liquid Glass 冇咁通透。</p>\n<p>由 iOS 27 同 macOS 27 Golden Gate 開始，Liquid Glass 唔再局限於兩種風格。Apple 引入咗外觀滑桿設計，用戶可以將 Liquid Glass 調得比以往更加通透，亦可以為 Liquid Glass 設定更加不透明但仍然現代嘅外觀。</p>\n<p>macOS 27 Golden Gate 預設採用中等透明度設定。系統喺初始設定過程中亦會提示用戶調整滑桿，用戶之後亦可以喺「系統設定」&gt;「外觀」入面再作調整。</p>\n<p>Liquid Glass 滑桿提供實時預覽功能，讓你預覽每個設定嘅效果。三個刻度分別代表最通透、中等同最不透明，但你亦可以將滑桿調校到刻度之間嘅任何位置。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-System-Settings-Ultraclear.webp?w=800\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-System-Settings-Default.webp?w=800\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-System-Settings-Fully-Tinted.webp?w=800\"/>\n<h2>Dock 工具列</h2>\n<p>Dock 係最顯眼、會隨住 Liquid Glass 滑桿設定而改變外觀嘅系統元件。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Ultraclear.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Default.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Fully-Tinted.webp\"/>\n<p>Dock 嘅外觀可以係清晰顯示你嘅桌面背景圖案，亦可以係更加不透明、輪廓更加分明嘅材質。</p>\n<p>以下係近距離睇嘅效果：</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Ultraclear.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Default.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Fully-Tinted.webp\"/>\n<h2>小工具</h2>\n<p>macOS 桌面小工具可以設定為全彩色、暗色，或者自動切換。Liquid Glass 滑桿亦會改變暗色小工具嘅外觀。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Widgets-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Widgets-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Widgets-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<h2>Apple Music 同 Podcasts</h2>\n<p>Apple Music 同 Podcasts 等有系統「正在播放」工具列嘅 app，會因應 Liquid Glass 滑桿嘅位置而呈現截然不同嘅外觀。</p>\n<p>以下係 Podcasts 嘅「正在播放」工具列效果：</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Now-Playing-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Now-Playing-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Now-Playing-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<p>而以下就係 Music 嘅效果：</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Music-Now-Playing-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Music-Now-Playing-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Music-Now-Playing-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<h2>更多</h2>\n<p>滑桿亦適用於側邊欄、工具列同工具列按鈕，令「相片」、Safari 同其他有視窗介面元素嘅 app 外觀有所改變。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Photos-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Photos-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Photos-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<p>macOS 27 Golden Gate 嘅 Liquid Glass 滑桿有一個特點，就係單一滑桿控制成個系統嘅 Liquid Glass 外觀。換言之，Dock、小工具同視窗介面元素都會採用同一種風格。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Additional-01.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Additional-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Additional-03.webp\"/>\n<p>你鍾意邊一種？更加通透、更加不透明，定係介乎兩者之間？我個人就非常鍾意喺我部 Mac 上睇到更加不透明嗰種成熟大方嘅感覺。當然，將滑桿調到更加通透嗰邊玩吓亦幾有趣，我好高興 macOS 27 Golden Gate 畀大家自行揀嘅權利。</p>\n<p>歡迎喺留言區分享你嘅睇法！</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/CMM-Body-Image-1.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T12:59:06.102998+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1291,"images":25,"source":"9to5Mac","fallback":"none"}}